sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Api as Minimal API
    participant Svc as OrderService
    participant Repo as IOrderRepository
    participant DB as SQLite (EF Core)

    Client->>Api: POST /api/orders
    Api->>Svc: CreateOrderAsync(dto)
    Svc->>Repo: GetProductAsync(id)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT
    DB-->>Repo: Product
    Repo-->>Svc: Product
    Svc->>Svc: Applica le regole di business
    Svc->>Repo: AddAsync(order)
    Repo->>DB: INSERT
    Svc-->>Api: OrderDto
    Api-->>Client: 201 Created
